🚁 Prototype

The prototype integrates environmental sensors with an ESP32-based embedded system mounted on a drone platform.

Sensor System
Component	Purpose
🧠 ESP32	Data acquisition and processing
🟢 MQ-4	Methane/gas sensing
🔵 MQ-135	Air-quality-related sensing
🌡️ DHT22	Temperature & humidity
🌤️ BMP280	Atmospheric pressure
📍 GPS	Location & timestamp
📡 LoRa	Long-range telemetry
🌬️ Wind Sensor	Wind speed & direction
🧠 How EID Works
1️⃣ Sense

Environmental sensors collect readings from the surrounding area.

2️⃣ Locate

GPS associates each measurement with its geographical location.

3️⃣ Process

The ESP32 collects and packages the sensor data.

4️⃣ Transmit

LoRa sends the telemetry to the ground station.

5️⃣ Map

The web platform converts GPS-tagged measurements into a spatial environmental map.

6️⃣ Predict

The AI layer analyzes historical and environmental data to estimate potential pollution trends.

7️⃣ Warn

The system generates alerts when configured risk conditions are detected.

